<script src='/js/vendor/dropzone.js'></script>
<style>
#drag-drop-upload { border: 2px dashed #94a3b8; border-radius:8px; height:200px; width:100%; max-width:420px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#94a3b8; font-size:0.9rem; margin-top:1rem; }
</style>

<div class="practice-page">
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to exercises</a>
  <h1 class="practice-title">File Upload</h1>
  <div class="practice-banner"><ul>
    <li>Use <code>sendKeys("/absolute/path/to/file")</code> on the file input to set a file</li>
    <li>Verify the filename appears after selection using <code>getAttribute("value")</code></li>
    <li>Click Upload and verify the success confirmation appears</li>
    <li>Test the drag-and-drop zone using Playwright's <code>page.setInputFiles()</code></li>
  </ul></div>

  <form method='POST' enctype='multipart/form-data' style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
    <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom:0.8rem;">
      <label style="font-weight:600; display:block; margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Choose a file</label>
      <input id='file-upload' type='file' name='file'>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" id='file-submit' type='submit'>Upload</button>
  </form>

  <p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Or drag and drop a file below:</p>
  <div class='dz-success-mark' id='drag-drop-upload'>Drop file here</div>

  <div id="preview-template" style="display:none;">
    <div class="dz-preview dz-file-preview">
      <div class="dz-details"><div class="dz-filename"><span data-dz-name></span></div></div>
      <div class="dz-success-mark"><span>✔</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  $('div#drag-drop-upload').dropzone({ url: '/upload', previewTemplate: $('#preview-template').html() });
</script>
